      "text_preview": "\n15. Petitioner/PW.1 in her examination-in-chief she deposed that, on 16.01.2023 at about 9.30 a.m.,\nshe was riding Scooter bearing Reg. No. MH-49-W-8607 on Seegehalli-Kadugodi Road slowly, when she reached rola market driver of the offendi"
