      "annotation_id": "4e87eac1b06941658d4f745e0a502b7a_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Considering all these aspects this tribunal has granted Rs.50,000/- under the head of pain and suffering."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ded2d974f9b4669ae6b667d3ca32c9e_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n21. MEDICAL EXPENSES:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71329be4e87e452dab1255cc6275eddf_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has pleaded in the petition that she has spent huge amount towards medical expenses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ece7a561140141719a246122cefa039d_91",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In support of her plea, she has produced 01 Dental Bill at Ex.P.15 to the tune of Rs.14,500/- and 24 Medical Bills at Ex.P.17 to the tune of Rs.46,005/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8a2a21ee268742329ca0e0ab80079fb8_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the petitioner also examined the Billing Supervisor at Manipal Hospital as PW.2, who deposed that,\npetitioner took treatment in Manipal Hospital and inpatient bill amount was Rs.5,74,382/- and insurance company has paid Rs.4,62,033"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "89bf78ce12d44a72990e1a8115ffde1d_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, looking to the injuries sustained and treatment taken by the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d97a8d9545d9452c9c88fdb2b05377f8_94",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner is entitled for compensation of Rs.1,29,964/- towards medical expenses.\n22. LOSS OF INCOME DURING THE LAID UP PERIOD:\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f2a7d7b4cc294a4e8b29eef48ea0f3e5_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has produced Ex.P.11 Discharge summary issued by Manipal Hospital,\nBengaluru, it reveals that, the petitioner took treatment from the said hospital from 16.01.2023 to 26.01.2023 i.e. for 10 days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "860fb5efdb014485b41dc243260ac839_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, at least 2 months is required to recover from the accidental injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7f0ef3cd5ccb45c59d2132aef35f85a0_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So, in the absence of any evidence in respect of the income of the petitioner, the petitioner might have monthly income at Rs.16,000/- as per the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka fixed notional income of the year 2023 at Rs.16,000/- per mont"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "83209ce51e4d4fefbe9618bfb5457767_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The accident is of the year is 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "510ba93b77cb4f779efeca983baeedcc_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, the income of the petitioner is considered as Rs.16,000/-p.m. as per above decision."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9bfd511f08f64d6bafee93a5fbe08321_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, 2 months is to be considered as loss of income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "664f2f5070e8422bb21db3eba06ee7c1_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled for compensation of Rs.32,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1353f5d9b5a642e39e755e70ed392a65_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. Towards loss of future earning capacity on account of Permanent Physical Disability-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "812c568b80dd414896990e76eb9f7d28_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner to prove her disability, she has produced the evidence of Dr. Deepu.N.K in order to substantiate the same, PW.4 who has opined that, total disability of right upper limb at 10% and that of whole body disability at 13.33%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "660c1b1a8669403b9aa69aa9278eef1b_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the PW.4 is a treated doctor."
    },
