    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c47dd346e8e4b18896f86ad787fc92d_130",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n27. LIABILITY:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62dfb75e4def4e4c9f34eaa6783594ef_131",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As discussed in issue No.1, the accident was occurred due to rash and negligent driving by the driver of the tractor & trailer bearing Reg. No. KA-07-T-0604 and KA-07-T-0605 and the police have conducted due enquiry and filed charge sheet a"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "282fd9db7b644a18a46777eff8964a67_132",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From perusal of the policy, the offending vehicle was insured with the respondent No.2 for the period from 27.06.2022 to 26.06.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a12cadfe47bb4528bc99eec6cf56617e_133",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the accident in question took place on 16.01.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "97e74d6d27074d5283ca769385e0ab6d_134",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, policy was in force at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6a9274005b514efcabb616b189ebd2b5_135",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though insurance company has taken contention that, owner of the offending vehicle i.e., respondent No.1 violates the terms and conditions of the policy."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85644091c75243309ed0f0d52d051b8f_136",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They have issued policy towards offending vehicle for the use of agricultural purpose, but he has used the said vehicle for commercial purpose."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cc6f34e5b38c42c09eb54882c8e03464_137",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, insurance company i.e.,\nrespondent No.2 is not liable to pay the compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0033b5d24d81415bbc0dc4ed55c9c307_138",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But in order to support his contention, respondent No.2 has not produced any documents to show that respondent No.1 used the offending vehicle for the commercial purpose."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fe5b4b30925d4c0e8d987af0b9f31026_139",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As such, respondent No.2/insurance company failed to prove that, respondent No.1 violates the terms and conditions of the policy."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f6f8675b34074ca3a77a2cfa21e6faae_140",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, in view of above discussion, the respondent No.1 and 2 are jointly severally liable to pay the compensation to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2bd7cda5d58d4d0c8dbcbc0a01346343_141",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, respondent No.2 being the insurer is liable to indemnify the respondent No.1 owner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9dd8fd64ad1a402eb79ada686f4a2336_142",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n28. INTEREST:"
    },
